hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\",\"start\":1376}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:a5d1e2dc58ef714944f421ff45941751777811cacd50ee563436207cd63ef05c\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"prohibition\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:64720adad1ac2582c8067095a4b7fae5d1636b6115c18231ee6a38ba09102504\",\"modality\":\"must_not\",\"modality_quote\":\"may not\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:f7e840fefdf620ad6689383b452eaca4b3ac292e20b996082603f9a42868b592\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\\n\\n(1) Any loaded firearm(s).\",\"references\":[\"§ 1562.23\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:0254f2ebb0888d1e050841a67ff94214d2c62613fc72c064964319e63744c6e3\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(c) In checked baggage. A passenger may not transport or offer for transport in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter:\"],\"scope_text\":\"In checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1376,\"summary\":\"A passenger may not transport or offer for transport any loaded firearm(s) in checked baggage or in baggage carried in an inaccessible cargo hold under § 1562.23 of this chapter.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
